  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>&#8477;</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>}</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>&#8477;</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>&#8734;</mo></munderover><mfrac><mn>3</mn><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>r</mi></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math></p><p>Now solving <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>&#8734;</mo></munderover><mfrac><mn>3</mn><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>r</mi></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now using infinite&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math>&nbsp;formula&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mo>&#8734;</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
